---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { releases, releaseStatus } from '../lib/releases';
---
<Base description="Find FanSnipe companion releases and checksums, with signing and testing status for each beta." title="FanSnipe Downloads — Local Recording Companion">
  <div class="wrap"><article class="prose">
    <div class="eyebrow">The companion / Downloads</div><h1>A studio for your device.</h1>
    {releases.length ? <>
      <p class="lead">Published companion releases, with checksums and release-specific status.</p>
      <p>Checksums help verify that a downloaded file matches the listed artifact. Signing and test status are described separately below.</p>
      {releases.map(release=><section>
        <h2>Version {release.version} · {release.stage === 'beta' ? 'Beta' : 'Stable'}</h2><p>Released {release.date} UTC</p>
        {releaseStatus(release).length>0 && <><h3>Signing and testing</h3><ul>{releaseStatus(release).map(status=><li>{status}</li>)}</ul></>}
        {release.notes.length>0 && <><h3>Release notes</h3><ul>{release.notes.map(note=><li>{note}</li>)}</ul></>}
        {release.container && <><h3>Docker image</h3><p>Linux AMD64 and ARM64 image: <code class="checksum">{release.container.reference}</code><br/>OCI image index digest: <code class="checksum">{release.container.digest}</code></p><p>The bundled dashboard is the default for Docker. The optional same-device hosted bridge requires the Docker 0.1.2-beta.1 image or a later bridge-enabled release. It is disabled by default and requires loopback access and local approval. <a href="/docs/">See setup guidance →</a></p></>}
        <h3>Downloads and verification files</h3><ul>{release.artifacts.map(artifact=><li><a href={artifact.url}>{artifact.label} ↗</a><br/><small>SHA-256: <code class="checksum">{artifact.sha256}</code></small></li>)}</ul>
        <p>{release.releaseUrl && <a href={release.releaseUrl}>Release notes and source ↗</a>}{release.verificationUrl && <> · <a href={release.verificationUrl}>Release manifest ↗</a></>}{release.checksumsUrl && <> · <a href={release.checksumsUrl}>Published checksums ↗</a></>}</p>
      </section>)}
    </> : <>
      <p class="lead">The companion is being prepared for macOS, Windows and Docker. Release downloads will appear here when their artifacts and status have been checked.</p>
      <h2>Release status</h2><p>No application release assets are listed yet. Visit the project repository for source and release updates.</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/Fanclan/FanSnipe-Companion">View the companion repository ↗</a></p>
    </>}
  </article></div>
</Base>

<style>
.checksum, li { overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }
</style>
